			<div class="content" id="post-content-1581585">
									

<p>The thing is, no matter how much 'there is no canon' people will slap onto you, there will always be a standard of how SCP articles are written. I would say the vast majority of articles refer to researchers as their researcher name like Assistant Researcher/Junior Researcher ClearlyIncompetent , Dr. Fuckwit, or Head Researcher NoEmpathy or something. While I have no problems to the other numerical terms labeled here(I've seen it done before and I have done it before without issue), the fact you basically did to researchers what most people do to d-class really confuses me, since I haven't seen such a thing happen before and don't know where you got that idea that it would be more tonally accurate.</p>

