			<div class="content" id="post-content-1581542">
									

<p>I like this. I am a sucker for computer-related SCPs, I appreciated the pictures and the logs, too; the procedure in of itself, with the random &quot;Please, no, stop&quot; words would be interesting enough. The end seemed somewhat hurried (why the loss of the senses); I expected an incident, I actually really wanted to open some kind of a &quot;Level 4 access only&quot; log with a cryptic message in the text, but not the damage to the researcher, I believe that was unneeded.</p>
<p>Also, the single character passages like &quot;aaaaaaaaaa&quot; seemed really&#8230; disturbing.</p>
<p>This is the first SCP I see from you, Carnage, and it seems people quite like the SCP, so keep it up!</p>

